# Cross-origin isolation lets DuckDB-WASM use its faster multi-threaded build.
# `credentialless` keeps cross-origin CDN + Google Fonts loading without extra
# headers on those origins. Read by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages.
#
# If DuckDB ever fails to load on your host, delete the Embedder-Policy line:
# the app falls back to the single-threaded build, which needs no isolation.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
